      "fix": "List multi-burst jobs and match exact names locally; never pass name= to find_jobs.",
      "tests_added": "tests/test_pilot_idempotency.py (8 tests, incl. a guard that find_existing never passes name=)",
      "verified": "A third --submit run submitted 0 jobs and credits remained at 7930.",
      "production_risk_mitigated": "At production scale (336 jobs) the same bug would have wasted 1680 credits."
    },
